)PANEL KEYLIST(ISRHELP,ISR)
)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
/*********************************************************************/
/* PANEL    : MBKBRVH                                                */
/* TITLE    : HELP - BEREAVEMENT INSTRUCTIONS                        */
/*-------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/* 2011-02-14 AOS  ORIGINAL                                          */
/* 2015-06-08 PDQ  SMALL ESTATE 25,000                               */
/*********************************************************************/
  % TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE) SKIP(ON)
  + TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN) SKIP(ON)
  ] TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) SKIP(ON)
)BODY EXPAND(//) WIDTH(80)
%TUTORIAL -/-/- BEREAVEMENT INSTRUCTIONS -/-/- TUTORIAL
%Command ===>_ZCMD                                                             +
+
+Use this dialog only when the Bereavement Workflow Tool is unavailable or
+cannot handle the case.  Instructions are processed by CFDEC010 at 19:00.
+
]N - notification of death+
+   CIF marked deceased; every account blocked for debits (credits still
+   accepted); standing orders and direct debits cancelled; loan
+   collections paused 90 days (interest continues unless freeze = Y);
+   letter BRV1 to the notifier.  The bereavement reference is allocated.
]P - probate / letters of administration+
+   Credit balances paid to the executor (MegaBank account: transfer;
+   other bank: CHAPS keyed by the team) and accounts closed.  Debit
+   balances and loans listed for the claim on the estate.  Without a
+   grant, release on%indemnity+if the estate is under 25,000 - team
+   leader only (they sign the indemnity).
]X - estate settled+   CIF closed if nothing remains open.
]R - reversal+         Notification in error.  Team leader only.  Debit
+   blocks lifted, but standing orders and direct debits are%not+
+   reinstated - phone the customer.
+
+Cut-off 18:45.  The CIF number is keyed twice - wrong-customer
+notifications were the main complaint theme in the 2011 review.
)PROC
  &ZUP = MBKMENUH
)END
